Migration
A migrator receives the loaded SaveGame ROOT node (i.e. the whole
document tree) and mutates it in-place to upgrade `fromVersion` →
`toVersion`. The manager applies migrations in chain order until
the schema matches GetCurrentSchema().

Example:
sg.RegisterMigration(1, 2, [](MdfNode& root){
auto* custom = root.FindChild("Custom");
if (!custom) return;
if (custom->HasProperty("gold")) {
auto v = custom->GetProperty("gold");
custom->RemoveProperty("gold");
auto& inv = custom->FindOrAddChild("Inventory");
inv.SetProperty("gold", v);

